OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,A'I'm telling the truth': Earl Spencer
OL,4,Adefends Diana book claims about Charles
OL,5,Ain BBC interview
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a strongly worded response,
OL,8,FBuckingham Palace said the King was
OL,9,F"mindful that the pain of fraternal
OL,10,Fgrief can cloud reason, affect
OL,11,Fjudgement and colour memory in ways
OL,12,Fothers do not recognise, even many
OL,13,Fyears after such a loss".
OL,15,FBut in his first interview since, Earl
OL,16,FSpencer said: "I can tell you here and
OL,17,Fnow, those are exactly the words he
OL,18,Fsaid."
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
