OL,3,ABillionaire Man United owner says he
OL,4,Ahas lost confidence in the UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of Britain's richest people, Sir
OL,7,FJim Ratcliffe, says he has lost
OL,8,Fconfidence in the UK, describing the
OL,9,Fcountry as "on the slide".
OL,11,FThe founder of petrochemical giant
OL,12,FIneos, who also owns a large stake in
OL,13,FManchester United, said the UK was in
OL,14,Fdecline due to a combination of high
OL,15,Ftaxes and high immigration.
OL,17,FHe told the BBC failing to invest
OL,18,Ffurther in North Sea oil and gas
OL,19,Famounted to "insanity" and warned gas
OL,20,Fstorage was so low that the UK could
OL,21,F"run out of gas" if there was a cold
OL,22,Fsnap this winter.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
