OL,3,AParents could lose benefits or face
OL,4,Aprison for child's crimes, minister
OL,5,Asays
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis comments come after the government
OL,8,Fset out plans in May to strengthen and
OL,9,Fexpand Parenting Orders, which can
OL,10,Fcurrently compel parents or guardians
OL,11,Fto address their child's behaviour by
OL,12,Fattending counselling sessions or face
OL,13,Ffines.
OL,15,FRichards said prison sentences would
OL,16,Fonly apply "in the most extreme cases"
OL,17,Fand would be up to judges' discretion.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
