OL,3,ATrump signs sweeping Russia sanctions
OL,4,Abill
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bill is named after the late
OL,7,FSenator Lindsey Graham, one of
OL,8,FUkraine's staunchest defenders in
OL,9,FWashington before his death on 11 July.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
